<title>USA: Kleinert's to go private, offers $18/shr.</title>
<headline>Kleinert's to go private, offers $18/shr.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH MEETING, Pa. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kleinert's Inc said Tuesday it had decided to go private and was offering to repurchase up to 1,000 shares from each shareholder at $18 cash per share.</p>
<p>The offer expires May 30, at which time Kleinert's will delist its shares from the Nasdaq market and cease being a reporting company under the Securities Exchange Act, it said.</p>
<p>Kleinert's shares were up 1/2 at 17-1/4 Tuesday afternoon. Their 52-week high was 19.</p>
